## Permissions
Permission rules live in [.claude/settings.json](.claude/settings.json). Baseline policy:
file edits apply without prompting (`defaultMode: acceptEdits`), so commit at each logical
checkpoint — git is the undo, not the edit prompt. `git push` prompts (ask); `sudo`, `rm -rf`,
reads of `.env*`, and reads of `~/.ssh/**` are denied. Do not weaken these — they are
drift-managed.
